{"suttaId":"thig6.4","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Thī","vriCode":"s0509m.mul","paras":[569,587],"vripara":"145"},"segments":{"thig6.4:0.3":"Sujātātherīgāthā","thig6.4:1.1":"“Alaṅkatā suvasanā, mālinī candanokkhitā;","thig6.4:1.3":"Sabbābharaṇasañchannā, dāsīgaṇapurakkhatā.","thig6.4:2.1":"“Annaṃ pānañca ādāya, khajjaṃ bhojjaṃ anappakaṃ;","thig6.4:2.3":"Gehato nikkhamitvāna, uyyānamabhihārayiṃ.","thig6.4:3.1":"“Tattha ramitvā kīḷitvā, āgacchantī sakaṃ gharaṃ;","thig6.4:3.3":"Vihāraṃ daṭṭhuṃ pāvisiṃ, sākete añjanaṃ vanaṃ.","thig6.4:4.1":"“Disvāna lokapajjotaṃ, vanditvāna upāvisiṃ;","thig6.4:4.3":"So me dhammamadesesi, anukampāya cakkhumā.","thig6.4:5.1":"“Sutvā ca kho mahesissa, saccaṃ sampaṭivijjhahaṃ;","thig6.4:5.3":"Tattheva virajaṃ dhammaṃ, phusayiṃ amataṃ padaṃ.","thig6.4:6.1":"“Tato viññātasaddhammā, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","thig6.4:6.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, amoghaṃ buddhasāsanan”ti.","thig6.4:7.1":"… Sujātā therī …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
